  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Geneva Centre for Security Sector Governance (DCAF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver effective security and justice interventions through the Geneva Centre for Security Sector Governance (DCAF) Team by providing guidance to help bilateral donors and multilateral organisations deliver effective and politically-informed security and justice responses based on lessons from the field and the evidence base. Also to improve the co-ordination and technical support between donors and their engagement with multilateral organisations in the security and justice sector.</narrative>
  </description>
